#: ../developer/contributing.md:1
msgid "Contributing"
msgstr "参与贡献"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:3
msgid ""
"HybridInference is MIT-licensed (see `LICENSE`) and contributions are "
"welcome. This page covers what the repository contains, the checks a "
"change has to pass, and how a change gets proposed."
msgstr ""
"HybridInference 采用 MIT 许可（见 "
"`LICENSE`），欢迎贡献。本页说明仓库里都有什么、一处改动要通过哪些检查，以及一处改动如何提出来。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:7
msgid "Getting set up"
msgstr "环境准备"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:15
msgid ""
"`make setup-dev` creates `.venv` on Python 3.12, installs the project "
"editable, syncs the `dev` dependency group and installs the pre-commit "
"hooks. Full prerequisites and the ways to run the gateway are in "
"[Installation](installation.md)."
msgstr ""
"`make setup-dev` 会用 Python 3.12 创建 `.venv`，以可编辑方式安装本项目，同步 `dev` 依赖组，并装上 "
"pre-commit 钩子。完整的前置条件和运行网关的各种方式见 [安装](installation.md)。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:20
msgid ""
"Every `make` target that touches Python runs through `uv run`. Override "
"that if your environment needs it:"
msgstr "每一个涉及 Python 的 `make` 目标都通过 `uv run` 执行。如果你的环境需要，可以覆盖它："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:27
msgid "Repository layout"
msgstr "仓库结构"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:55
msgid "Two things about the backend are easy to get wrong:"
msgstr "后端有两件事很容易搞错："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:57
msgid ""
"`apps/backend/routing/executor.py` is a backward-compatibility shim that "
"re-exports `FixedRouter` as `RouteExecutor`. Edit "
"`apps/backend/routing/routers.py` instead."
msgstr ""
"`apps/backend/routing/executor.py` 是一个向后兼容的垫片，把 `FixedRouter` 以 "
"`RouteExecutor` 的名字重新导出。要改就改 `apps/backend/routing/routers.py`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:60
msgid ""
"The backend packages are `serving` and `routing`, rooted at "
"`apps/backend`. Anything you run by hand needs `PYTHONPATH=apps/backend`;"
" pytest gets it from `pythonpath` in `pyproject.toml`."
msgstr ""
"后端的包是 `serving` 和 `routing`，根目录在 `apps/backend`。任何手工运行的东西都需要 "
"`PYTHONPATH=apps/backend`；pytest 则从 `pyproject.toml` 的 `pythonpath` 里拿到它。"

