#: ../developer/contributing.md:74
msgid ""
"`make all` does **not** type-check. `mypy` is in the `dev` dependency "
"group and you may run it by hand, but `pyproject.toml` has no "
"`[tool.mypy]` section and no target invokes it, so nothing enforces it."
msgstr ""
"`make all` **不**做类型检查。`mypy` 在 `dev` 依赖组里，你可以手工运行它，但 `pyproject.toml` 里没有"
" `[tool.mypy]` 段，也没有任何 target 会调用它，所以没有任何东西强制它。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:78
msgid "Style is enforced by tooling, not by review:"
msgstr "代码风格由工具强制，而不是靠评审："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:80
msgid ""
"**ruff**, line length 100, target `py310`, with "
"`E`/`W`/`F`/`I`/`UP`/`B`/`C4`/ `SIM`/`TCH`/`RUF` enabled (`[tool.ruff]` "
"in `pyproject.toml`)."
msgstr ""
"**ruff**，行长 100，target 为 `py310`，启用 "
"`E`/`W`/`F`/`I`/`UP`/`B`/`C4`/`SIM`/`TCH`/`RUF`（见 `pyproject.toml` 的 "
"`[tool.ruff]`）。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:82
msgid ""
"**pydocstyle**, Google convention. It skips `tests`, `.venv`, "
"`node_modules`, `apps/frontend`, `ops` and `docs`, so docstrings are "
"required in `apps/backend` and enforced there."
msgstr ""
"**pydocstyle**，Google 约定。它跳过 "
"`tests`、`.venv`、`node_modules`、`apps/frontend`、`ops` 和 `docs`，因此 "
"`apps/backend` 里必须写 docstring，并且在那里被强制执行。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:86
msgid "Pre-commit hooks run on commit and are installed by `make setup-dev`:"
msgstr "pre-commit 钩子在 commit 时运行，由 `make setup-dev` 安装："

#: ../developer/contributing.md:92
msgid ""
"They cover ruff (pinned to the version CI uses), pydocstyle, `gitleaks` "
"secret scanning, the standard whitespace/YAML/JSON/TOML checks, and "
"eslint + prettier for `apps/frontend`."
msgstr ""
"它们涵盖 ruff（版本锁定为 CI 所用的那个）、pydocstyle、`gitleaks` "
"密钥扫描、标准的空白字符/YAML/JSON/TOML 检查，以及针对 `apps/frontend` 的 eslint + prettier。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:96
msgid ""
"Before opening a pull request, run `make format` and make sure `make "
"test` passes."
msgstr "开 PR 之前，先跑 `make format`，并确认 `make test` 通过。"

