msgid ""
"pytest across four shards with a PostgreSQL service, `-m \"not "
"external\"` — so the `dbtest` tier does run in CI even though it is "
"excluded from `make test`"
msgstr ""
"在带 PostgreSQL 服务的四个分片上跑 pytest，`-m \"not external\"`——因此 `dbtest` 这一层虽然被 "
"`make test` 排除，在 CI 里却确实会跑"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Security Scan"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid ""
"`gitleaks detect` over the tree, then `pip-audit` against the exported "
"production requirements"
msgstr "对整棵代码树跑 `gitleaks detect`，再对导出的生产依赖清单跑 `pip-audit`"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "`docker-build`"
msgstr ""

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "builds the affected images, then starts the runnable example and smokes it"
msgstr "构建受影响的镜像，然后启动那个可运行的 example 并对它做冒烟测试"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "Tutorial E2E"
msgstr ""

