"runs the Router Tutorial's `make up` → `make smoke` → `make demo` → `make"
" demo-smoke` transition"
msgstr "跑快速开始里的 `make up` → `make smoke` → `make demo` → `make demo-smoke` 全流程"

#: ../developer/contributing.md
msgid "CI Gate"
msgstr ""

