msgid "aggregates the results of the jobs above into one check"
msgstr "把上面各个 job 的结果汇总成一个检查项"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:351
msgid ""
"Because CI includes `dbtest`, a change to storage or auth can be green "
"locally and red in CI. Run `make test-db` against a local Postgres when "
"you touch `apps/backend/serving/storage/` or the auth surface."
msgstr ""
"因为 CI 包含 `dbtest`，改动存储或认证时，可能本地全绿而 CI 报红。动到 "
"`apps/backend/serving/storage/` 或认证那一面时，要对着本地 Postgres 跑一遍 `make test-"
"db`。"

#: ../developer/contributing.md:355
msgid ""
"If a pull request shows no CI run at all, check whether it has a merge "
"conflict first — a conflicted pull request does not trigger the "
"`pull_request` workflow."
msgstr "如果一个 PR 一次 CI 运行都没有，先看它是不是有合并冲突——有冲突的 PR 不会触发 `pull_request` workflow。"

